{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 362.944,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now there was no more contention in all the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.313,
      "end": 7.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "among all the people who belonged to king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.558,
      "end": 12.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so that king Benjamin had continual peace all the remainder of his days.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.207,
      "end": 16.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he had three sons;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.22,
      "end": 20.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he called their names Mosiah, and Helorum, and Helaman.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.347,
      "end": 22.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he caused that they should be taught",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.803,
      "end": 25.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in all the language of his fathers,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.398,
      "end": 28.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might become men of understanding;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.968,
      "end": 32.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they might know concerning the prophecies",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.306,
      "end": 35.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been spoken by the mouths of their fathers,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.69,
      "end": 39.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were delivered them by the hand of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.76,
      "end": 42.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also taught them concerning the records",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.587,
      "end": 46.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven on the plates of brass, saying:",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.343,
      "end": 48.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My sons, I would that ye should remember",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.17,
      "end": 51.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that were it not for these plates,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 51.718,
      "end": 54.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain these records and these commandments,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.056,
      "end": 57.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we must have suffered in ignorance,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.744,
      "end": 59.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even at this present time,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.921,
      "end": 62.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not knowing the mysteries of God.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 63.062,
      "end": 66.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it were not possible that our father, Lehi,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.586,
      "end": 68.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "could have remembered all these things,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 68.809,
      "end": 71.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to have taught them to his children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 71.311,
      "end": 74.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were for the help of these plates;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 74.417,
      "end": 78.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he having been taught in the language of the Egyptians",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 78.219,
      "end": 80.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he could read these engravings,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 80.86,
      "end": 82.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and teach them to his children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 83.13,
      "end": 86.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they could teach them to their children,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 86.282,
      "end": 88.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and so fulfilling the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 89.016,
      "end": 91.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to this present time.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 91.879,
      "end": 93.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you, my sons,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 93.731,
      "end": 95.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were it not for these things,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 95.722,
      "end": 99.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have been kept and preserved by the hand of God,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 99.571,
      "end": 103.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might read and understand of his mysteries,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 103.28,
      "end": 106.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have his commandments always before our eyes,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 106.525,
      "end": 109.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that even our fathers would have dwindled in unbelief,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 109.724,
      "end": 113.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we should have been like unto our brethren, the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 113.759,
      "end": 116.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who know nothing concerning these things,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 116.586,
      "end": 119.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or even do not believe them when they are taught them,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 120.063,
      "end": 123.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because of the traditions of their fathers,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 123.262,
      "end": 124.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are not correct.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 125.475,
      "end": 126.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my sons,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 126.77,
      "end": 130.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should remember that these sayings are true,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 130.201,
      "end": 132.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that these records are true.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 132.842,
      "end": 135.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, also the plates of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 135.716,
      "end": 139.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain the records and the sayings of our fathers",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 139.565,
      "end": 142.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from the time they left Jerusalem until now,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 142.578,
      "end": 143.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are true;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 144.012,
      "end": 146.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we can know of their surety",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 146.746,
      "end": 149.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because we have them before our eyes.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 149.98,
      "end": 151.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my sons,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 151.553,
      "end": 153.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should remember",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 153.73,
      "end": 155.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to search them diligently,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 155.86,
      "end": 157.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may profit thereby;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 157.944,
      "end": 161.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I would that ye should keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 161.653,
      "end": 163.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may prosper in the land",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 163.923,
      "end": 167.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according to the promises which the Lord made unto our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 168.318,
      "end": 171.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many more things did king Benjamin teach his sons,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 171.981,
      "end": 173.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are not written in this book.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 174.611,
      "end": 179.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after king Benjamin had made an end of teaching his sons,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 179.528,
      "end": 181.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he waxed old,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 181.194,
      "end": 184.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw that he must very soon go the way of all the earth;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 185.043,
      "end": 190.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, he thought it expedient that he should confer the kingdom upon one of his sons.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 191.574,
      "end": 194.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, he had Mosiah brought before him;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 194.633,
      "end": 197.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these are the words which he spake unto him, saying:",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 197.785,
      "end": 198.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My son,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 199.033,
      "end": 201.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should make a proclamation",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 201.767,
      "end": 204.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "throughout all this land among all this people,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 205.058,
      "end": 207.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 207.188,
      "end": 210.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people of Mosiah who dwell in the land,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 210.247,
      "end": 212.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they may be gathered together;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 213.121,
      "end": 216.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for on the morrow I shall proclaim unto this my people",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 216.691,
      "end": 218.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "out of mine own mouth",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 218.496,
      "end": 221.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou art a king and a ruler over this people,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 222.066,
      "end": 224.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom the Lord our God hath given us.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 225.068,
      "end": 228.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I shall give this people a name,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 228.359,
      "end": 232.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they may be distinguished above all the people",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 232.254,
      "end": 235.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord God hath brought out of the land of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 236.056,
      "end": 239.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this I do because they have been a diligent people",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 239.998,
      "end": 242.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in keeping the commandments of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 243.046,
      "end": 246.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I give unto them a name that never shall be blotted out,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 247.127,
      "end": 249.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be through transgression.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 250.036,
      "end": 252.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and moreover I say unto you",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 252.631,
      "end": 257.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if this highly favored people of the Lord should fall into transgression,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 257.501,
      "end": 260.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become a wicked and an adulterous people,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 261.118,
      "end": 263.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord will deliver them up,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 263.527,
      "end": 267.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they become weak like unto their brethren;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 267.283,
      "end": 271.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will no more preserve them by his matchless and marvelous power,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 271.968,
      "end": 274.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as he has hitherto preserved our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 275.202,
      "end": 276.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I say unto you",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 276.961,
      "end": 281.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if he had not extended his arm in the preservation of our fathers",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 281.878,
      "end": 285.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they must have fallen into the hands of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 285.402,
      "end": 287.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become victims to their hatred.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 288.497,
      "end": 293.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after king Benjamin had made an end of these sayings to his son,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 294.064,
      "end": 298.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he gave him charge concerning all the affairs of the kingdom.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 298.97,
      "end": 302.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, he also gave him charge concerning the records",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 302.958,
      "end": 305.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven on the plates of brass;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 305.971,
      "end": 308.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the plates of Nephi;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 308.334,
      "end": 310.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, the sword of Laban,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 310.929,
      "end": 312.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the ball or director,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 312.967,
      "end": 315.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which led our fathers through the wilderness,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 315.794,
      "end": 318.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was prepared by the hand of the Lord",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 318.714,
      "end": 321.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might be led, every one",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 321.588,
      "end": 325.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according to the heed and diligence which they gave unto him.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 325.705,
      "end": 328.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as they were unfaithful",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 328.439,
      "end": 331.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did not prosper nor progress in their journey,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 331.684,
      "end": 333.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but were driven back,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 333.443,
      "end": 336.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and incurred the displeasure of God upon them;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 336.363,
      "end": 340.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore they were smitten with famine and sore afflictions,",
